Output "/var/tmp/sesync-demo/out/popup-herdr.mp4"
Source common.tape
Hide
Type "/var/tmp/sesync-demo/reset-herdr.sh; . /var/tmp/sesync-demo/env.sh; rm -f ~/.config/sesync/tui.json; cd ~/projects/webshop; clear" Enter
Sleep 2s
Show
Sleep 300ms
Type "herdr" Sleep 300ms Enter
Sleep 4s
Ctrl+Alt+S Sleep 4s
Down Sleep 600ms Down Sleep 600ms Down Sleep 600ms Up Sleep 600ms Up Sleep 1.5s
Type "o" Sleep 7s
Ctrl+Alt+S Sleep 2.5s
Up Sleep 500ms Up Sleep 500ms Up Sleep 500ms Up Sleep 500ms Up Sleep 500ms Up Sleep 1s
Type "o" Sleep 6s
